  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Practices for Family Farming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASSESOAR, $461,762 over 5 years Associao de Estudos, Orientao, e Assistncia Rural (ASSESOAR) will finalize the implementation of different types of demonstration plots on family farms and at rural schools that show the benefits of agro-ecological practices, offering viable alternatives for local small-scale farmers. ASSESOAR will continue to work in eight municipalities in the southeastern region of Paran state, creating awareness about these technologies and their effectiveness and will use the additional year to systematize lessons learned and produce dissemination material for beneficiaries and greater public. Through these activities, approximately 2,000 people will directly benefit from the IAF grant, while an additional 25,000 will learn from the activities and gain familiarity with the new agro-ecological technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
